Witnessing can witness itself.

**Rule 9: Fidelity Loop**

\[
\frac{\text{Encounter}(x)}{\text{Encounter}(x) \to \mathcal{W}(x) \to \text{Articulate}(x) \to \text{Test}(x) \to \text{Revise}(x) \to \text{Encounter}(x)}
